  "protocol": {
    "cls": "escpr-rgb",
    "family": "escpr",
    "summary": "ESC/P-R: host sends RGB (dsnd RLE or RHV2 band), FIRMWARE does ink separation. Per-channel host control NOT available on this class. Commands: ESC q setq / ESC j setj|sets|endj / ESC p setn|sttp|endp / ESC d dsnd. Enter: ESC ( R 06 00 00 \"ESCPR\"; exit packet mode first: 00 00 00 1b 01 40 EJL 1284.4. RHV2 variant: same dsnd with band header {rows:1,x:2BE,y:2BE,w:2BE}+18B params + per-plane rows [lenBE32][bit-delta-Huffman w/ static code/leng tables in RHV2Comp.o]."
  },
